        "original_id": "b8f3873d-32bf-55ca-bc56-c0d71d14b57f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: “Mmm Papi”, “La Isla Bonita”, “True Blue”\n- People: Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Bruce Gaitsch\n- Concepts: Latin pop influence\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Madonna released her third studio album “True Blue”.\n- In 1987, Madonna’s song “La Isla Bonita” was noted as similar in style to the Latin pop influence of “Mmm Papi”.\n- “La Isla Bonita” is a song by American singer Madonna from the album “True Blue”.\n- Madonna and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced “La Isla Bonita”.\n- Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting for “La Isla Bonita”.\n- “Mmm Papi” is noted for having a Latin pop influence similar to Madonna’s “La Isla Bonita”.",
